[2m[2mSession[0m: [1;33mollama_glm-5.1_cloud-feature-trial-2[0m[0m
All 6 features are implemented and verified. Here's a summary of the changes:

### `app/auth.py` — Authentication
- `require_api_key` now reads the `X-API-Key` header, validates it against `VALID_API_KEYS`, raises HTTP 401 if missing/invalid, and returns the username string on success.

### `app/main.py` — All route changes

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **GET /tasks filtering** | Added optional `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` query params. All are combinable — applied as successive filters on the in-memory list. |
| **GET /tasks pagination** | Added `page` (default 1, min 1) and `page_size` (default 20, min 1) query params. Returns the sliced result after filtering. |
| **POST /tasks** | Requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`. Validates `project_id` exists (404 if not). Auto-generates ID as `max(existing IDs) + 1`. Returns 201 with the created task. |
| **PUT /tasks/{task_id}** | Requires auth. Uses `TaskUpdate` (all fields optional) with `model_dump(exclude_unset=True)` for true partial updates. Returns 404 if task not found. |
| **DELETE /tasks/{task_id}** | Requires auth. Returns 204 on success, 404 if task not found. |
